Browser DOOM — licensing
========================

This repository is a browser wrapper around third-party software and game data.
The MIT license below applies ONLY to the wrapper code written for this project:

    index.html, style.css, app.js, config.js, and the documentation files.

It does NOT apply to, and confers no rights over, any of the bundled third-party
components, each of which remains under its own license and the copyright of its
own authors:

  * engine/doomgeneric.{js,wasm,data} — the doomgeneric DOOM engine (a fork of
    id Software's LinuxDOOM 1.10), licensed GPL-2.0. See engine/LICENSE.
  * engine/doomgeneric.data also contains id Software's proprietary DOOM
    shareware IWAD and the Gravis Ultrasound instrument patches.
  * public/freedoom1.wad — Freedoom Phase 1, (C) the Freedoom contributors,
    modified BSD license.

DOOM and the DOOM engine are the work of id Software. This project is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by id Software, ZeniMax, or Microsoft.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for full attribution, license texts, and the GPL-2.0
source offer.

